  "title": "CHAPTER 9: CLOUD COMPUTING AND MODERN INFRASTRUCTURE",
  "order": 9,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "8qzmjz9",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9.1 Cloud Computing Fundamentals"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Cloud Service Models are divided into Infrastructure as a Service (IaaS), Platform as a Service (PaaS), and Software as a Service (SaaS).",
        "Cloud Deployment Models include Public, Private, Hybrid, and Community Cloud systems.",
        "Virtualisation relies on hypervisors to create hardware-isolated Virtual Machines, each running a full guest OS.",
        "Containers provide OS-level virtualisation, sharing the host operating system kernel for lightweight execution.",
        "Kubernetes (K8s) is the leading container orchestration tool for automated deployment, scaling, and management."
      ],
      "id": "1z8onbo"
    },
    {
      "type": "statStrip",
      "stats": [
        {
          "label": "Service Models",
          "value": "3 Types",
          "icon": "book"
        },
        {
          "label": "Deployment Models",
          "value": "4 Types",
          "icon": "info"
        },
        {
          "label": "Major Providers",
          "value": "AWS, Azure, GCP",
          "icon": "award"
        },
        {
          "label": "Key Container Tool",
          "value": "Kubernetes (K8s)",
          "icon": "check"
        }
      ],
      "id": "i6vr6v9"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9gqgfxx",
      "content": "Cloud computing is the delivery of computing services — servers, storage, databases, networking, software, analytics, and intelligence — over the Internet ('the cloud') to offer faster innovation, flexible resources, and economies of scale."
    },
    {
      "id": "9mvzpa5",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Characteristic</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Description</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>On-demand Self-service</p>",
            "<p>Users provision resources without human interaction with provider</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Broad Network Access</p>",
            "<p>Available over network; accessible by diverse client platforms</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Resource Pooling</p>",
            "<p>Multi-tenant model; shared physical resources dynamically assigned</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Rapid Elasticity</p>",
            "<p>Scale resources up or down quickly based on demand</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Measured Service</p>",
            "<p>Resource usage monitored; pay for what you use (utility computing)</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
