    {
      "id": "bnn909o",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "9.5 Virtualisation and Containers"
    },
    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Frequently tested: Classification of cloud service offerings (e.g., AWS EC2 as IaaS vs Google App Engine as PaaS vs Gmail as SaaS).",
        "Crucial distinction: Virtual Machines require dedicated Guest OS, whereas Containers share the Host OS kernel.",
        "Key definition: Hybrid Cloud integrates public and private cloud environments, while Community Cloud serves specific multi-organizational user groups."
      ],
      "id": "c32vid6"
    },
    {
      "id": "n3i0y3a",
      "type": "table",
      "rows": [
        {
          "isHeader": true,
          "cells": [
            "<p><strong>Aspect</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Virtual Machines (VMs)</strong></p>",
            "<p><strong>Containers (Docker)</strong></p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Isolation</p>",
            "<p>Full OS isolation; hypervisor level</p>",
            "<p>Process-level isolation; shared OS kernel</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Size</p>",
            "<p>GBs (includes full OS)</p>",
            "<p>MBs (only app + dependencies)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Startup Time</p>",
            "<p>Minutes (boots OS)</p>",
            "<p>Seconds (starts process)</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Resource Usage</p>",
            "<p>Heavy; own kernel, memory, CPU</p>",
            "<p>Lightweight; share host OS kernel</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Portability</p>",
            "<p>Less portable; hardware-dependent</p>",
            "<p>Highly portable; runs anywhere Docker runs</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Security</p>",
            "<p>Stronger isolation</p>",
            "<p>Weaker (shared kernel); namespaces/cgroups for isolation</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Technology</p>",
            "<p>VMware, VirtualBox, KVM, Hyper-V</p>",
            "<p>Docker, containerd, Podman</p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "isHeader": false,
          "cells": [
            "<p>Use Cases</p>",
            "<p>Legacy apps, different OS needs, strong isolation</p>",
            "<p>Microservices, CI/CD, scalable cloud apps</p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
